  "worked_solution": "First, we calculate $P(A)$ using the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ 0.75 & =P(A)+0.45-0.2 \\\\ P(A) & =0.75+0.2-0.45 \\\\  & =0.5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P({A}^{\u2032}) & =1-P(A) \\\\  & =1-0.5 \\\\  & =0.5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
